## How to Run Locally

1. Clone the repo  
   ```bash
   git clone https://github.com/JfundsTMT/moodmirror-clean.git
   cd moodmirror-clean/client
   ```

2. Install dependencies  
   ```bash
   npm install
   ```

3. Add your `.env` file  
   ```
   REACT_APP_OPENAI_API_KEY=your-api-key
   ```

4. Start the app  
   ```bash
   npm start
   ```

